WEBVTT

00:00:01.160 --> 00:00:03.330
My passionate Idol Activities,

00:00:03.330 --> 00:00:06.300
Aikatsu! is about to start!

00:00:07.900 --> 00:00:12.550
The one opportunity we have to challenge the Academy's top idol, the Starlight Queen—

00:00:12.550 --> 00:00:13.910
The Fresh Girls Cup.

00:00:14.860 --> 00:00:21.060
Yes, an event where every student is allowed to challenge our inspiration, Mizuki-chan.

00:00:21.060 --> 00:00:26.140
Aoi, Ran, and I were the only ones who made it to the semifinals.

00:00:28.090 --> 00:00:29.820
You made it to the semifinals.

00:00:30.300 --> 00:00:31.920
Congratulations!

00:00:36.080 --> 00:00:37.550
Thanks, you two!

00:00:37.550 --> 00:00:40.060
I'm so glad! Love you!

00:00:40.060 --> 00:00:41.810
Thank you.

00:00:41.810 --> 00:00:46.070
<i>The</i> Otome-chan and <i>the</i> Sakura-chan are celebrating with me.

00:00:46.070 --> 00:00:51.690
<i>The</i> Ran and Ichigo are challenging <i>the</i> Mizuki-chan with me!

00:00:51.690 --> 00:00:52.970
Too many "the"s.

00:00:52.970 --> 00:00:54.490
We've still got a ways to go. {the fight starts now}

00:00:54.490 --> 00:00:55.820
Don't forget me.

00:00:55.820 --> 00:00:58.320
I've awakened from my slumber.

00:00:58.320 --> 00:01:00.950
Is that what you were doing in your room?

00:01:01.510 --> 00:01:03.330
Would you mind not putting it so simply?

00:01:04.330 --> 00:01:07.330
It's not like I won't not celebrate for you!

00:01:07.330 --> 00:01:08.160
Which is it?

00:01:08.160 --> 00:01:09.840
I think she means "yes".

00:01:09.840 --> 00:01:12.630
Yurika-sama will grace us with her presence too.

00:01:14.290 --> 00:01:15.130
Thanks.

00:01:16.800 --> 00:01:18.090
I'll suck your blood!

00:01:18.090 --> 00:01:19.850
So cute!

00:01:20.470 --> 00:01:24.600
Looking back, you all showed us a splendid performance.

00:01:24.600 --> 00:01:27.230
It was impossible for a beginner such as myself.

00:01:27.230 --> 00:01:32.280
It truly was a miracle that Mizuki-sama was able to win in her very first year.

00:01:32.280 --> 00:01:37.490
Yeah, and ever since then, she hasn't given up her throne as the top idol even once.

00:01:37.490 --> 00:01:39.510
If you can win against her,

00:01:39.510 --> 00:01:42.790
then that means you're really, really, reaally amazing!

00:01:42.790 --> 00:01:44.790
There's no question about that.

00:01:44.790 --> 00:01:47.670
Everyone, please do your best in the semifinals.

00:01:47.670 --> 00:01:51.040
Nobody's expecting you to win, so at least make it exciting.

00:01:51.040 --> 00:01:54.050
Don't worry, we'll put our hearts into it.

00:01:54.050 --> 00:01:58.300
Alright, this may be our hardest fight yet, but let's go for it.

00:01:58.300 --> 00:01:59.520
Right.

00:01:59.520 --> 00:02:01.000
With that over with...

00:02:02.090 --> 00:02:04.890
Let's dig in!

00:03:50.680 --> 00:03:53.140
Aoi... you awake?

00:03:53.670 --> 00:03:54.920
Yeah.

00:03:54.920 --> 00:03:56.630
I'm too nervous to sleep.

00:03:56.630 --> 00:03:57.700
Same here.

00:03:57.700 --> 00:04:01.320
The semifinal is tomorrow. We really need to get our sleep.

00:04:08.180 --> 00:04:09.470
Did I wake you? {mine for this, yours for next}

00:04:09.470 --> 00:04:10.470
Ran!

00:04:12.290 --> 00:04:13.190
Could it be...

00:04:15.580 --> 00:04:17.190
Sleepover mode? {Maybe? I like modes...}

00:04:17.640 --> 00:04:19.450
I couldn't help it...

00:04:19.450 --> 00:04:21.450
I just can't get to sleep.

00:04:22.480 --> 00:04:23.890
Thanks for the pic. {shot?} {It's fine}

00:04:25.740 --> 00:04:30.080
It's no surprise we're all nervous 
considering who our opponent is.

00:04:30.080 --> 00:04:30.860
Yeah.

00:04:30.860 --> 00:04:32.640
Rare!

00:04:34.540 --> 00:04:36.090
How long are you gonna keep looking?

00:04:36.090 --> 00:04:41.790
Saving to the blushing folder in my Ran folder in my Aikatsu folder... done!

00:04:41.790 --> 00:04:44.010
Don't make that folder!

00:04:44.010 --> 00:04:45.110
Let me see too!

00:04:45.110 --> 00:04:46.310
Don't!

00:04:47.190 --> 00:04:48.550
Ichigo.

00:04:48.550 --> 00:04:50.060
I'll show you later.

00:04:50.060 --> 00:04:51.080
Sure!

00:04:51.080 --> 00:04:52.460
Give me a break...

00:04:53.560 --> 00:04:58.320
Then since we all can't sleep, let's do a bit of research on Mizuki-chan. {Ran wears heels at night? Also, this position...} {That position...}

00:04:58.870 --> 00:05:00.070
Research?

00:05:00.070 --> 00:05:00.870
Yep.

00:05:02.590 --> 00:05:06.070
I just got the newest in reference material this morning.

00:05:06.550 --> 00:05:07.820
Ta-da! {Wiktionary suggests this is the more common spelling?}

00:05:09.300 --> 00:05:10.470
It's "Monthly Mizuki"! {thank you for making this pun or whatever easy to do}

00:05:10.470 --> 00:05:11.930
It's the new issue!

00:05:13.780 --> 00:05:16.460
The first shots are of Mizuki-chan in her casual clothes.

00:05:16.460 --> 00:05:17.770
She's so cute.

00:05:17.770 --> 00:05:21.340
Next they have... Mizuki's recommended sweets! {like adult chocolate}

00:05:21.340 --> 00:05:23.110
They look so good!

00:05:23.110 --> 00:05:25.550
It's even better when Mizuki-chan's the one eating them.

00:05:27.410 --> 00:05:30.730
Hang on a sec, will this really help us with the semifinals?

00:05:31.240 --> 00:05:32.440
We got caught in the heat of the moment.

00:05:32.440 --> 00:05:33.830
Let's focus.

00:05:34.480 --> 00:05:35.810
Ah, this is...

00:05:37.290 --> 00:05:39.010
This is serious.

00:05:39.010 --> 00:05:42.440
Mizuki-chan started a new clothing brand.

00:05:46.590 --> 00:05:48.350
It's called Love Queen. {full caps?}

00:05:48.350 --> 00:05:52.910
It was created to fit Mizuki-chan—
a brand for Mizuki-chan alone.

00:05:52.910 --> 00:05:54.950
That's amazing. What's it like?

00:05:56.560 --> 00:05:58.960
A feeling of royalty befitting the top idol.

00:05:58.960 --> 00:06:00.330
A roll? {joke, halp} {it's fine, they're all in English}

00:06:00.330 --> 00:06:02.590
Dazzling jewelry.

00:06:02.590 --> 00:06:04.210
Jelly? {damn you, food}

00:06:04.210 --> 00:06:06.020
We're not talking about food.

00:06:06.560 --> 00:06:07.690
My bad.

00:06:07.690 --> 00:06:08.650
Geez...

00:06:08.650 --> 00:06:09.970
Let's keep going.

00:06:09.970 --> 00:06:15.390
Finally, they took Mizuki-chan's symbol, the moon, and based their luxurious designs on it.

00:06:16.260 --> 00:06:18.640
It gives off a refined and mature air.

00:06:18.640 --> 00:06:20.720
She's a real celebrity.

00:06:20.720 --> 00:06:23.610
Mizuki-chan's as beautiful as a princess.

00:06:23.610 --> 00:06:25.900
And it doesn't stop at just her looks.

00:06:25.900 --> 00:06:29.390
Only she can pull off that many Special Appeals in a row...

00:06:31.200 --> 00:06:33.620
She lies far beyond our reach.

00:06:33.620 --> 00:06:34.820
Yeah.

00:06:34.820 --> 00:06:37.620
The difference between Mizuki-chan and us three

00:06:37.620 --> 00:06:39.400
is like that between the moon and a soft-shelled turtle.

00:06:39.400 --> 00:06:40.460
A soft-shelled turtle?

00:06:40.460 --> 00:06:42.710
You mean <i>that</i>, right?

00:06:44.710 --> 00:06:46.460
Poke, poke, poke.

00:06:46.880 --> 00:06:50.970
It's the one that never lets go once it's grabbed on to something, right?

00:06:52.800 --> 00:06:54.120
That may be true,

00:06:54.690 --> 00:06:57.360
but the reason those two are compared

00:06:59.430 --> 00:07:03.280
is that despite the fact that they're both round, they're completely different.

00:07:04.480 --> 00:07:06.110
So what that means is...

00:07:06.110 --> 00:07:10.850
Even though we're idols like Mizuki-san, you can't even compare us.

00:07:10.850 --> 00:07:14.870
So while Mizuki-chan's the moon, we're just soft-shelled turtles.

00:07:15.750 --> 00:07:18.160
Ah, this page has some useful info too.

00:07:18.160 --> 00:07:19.260
Let me see.

00:07:32.440 --> 00:07:34.890
Okay, we're going to train until the very last minute.

00:07:58.730 --> 00:08:00.280
This could be useful.

00:08:00.280 --> 00:08:01.250
What is it?

00:08:01.250 --> 00:08:02.920
It's something Mizuki-chan said.

00:08:02.920 --> 00:08:06.430
When training for Aikatsu, the 
fundamentals may be important,

00:08:06.430 --> 00:08:09.690
but you should also tailor your own training to suit yourself.

00:08:09.690 --> 00:08:11.290
To suit yourself?

00:08:11.290 --> 00:08:11.920
Right.

00:08:11.920 --> 00:08:14.330
You want to show off your strengths.

00:08:14.330 --> 00:08:15.680
I understand.

00:08:15.680 --> 00:08:19.430
We should figure out what it is that we do best.

00:08:19.430 --> 00:08:21.640
What we do best...

00:08:21.640 --> 00:08:23.940
I'm gonna head to the library.

00:08:24.280 --> 00:08:25.330
Why?

00:08:25.330 --> 00:08:28.690
I'm going to study up on past Fresh Girls Cups.

00:08:29.070 --> 00:08:32.190
I think that research really does suit me best.

00:08:32.190 --> 00:08:34.700
You're right. Then let's meet up later.

00:08:34.700 --> 00:08:35.610
Yeah.

00:08:36.210 --> 00:08:38.090
I'm going to the lesson room too.

00:08:38.090 --> 00:08:38.950
You too?

00:08:38.950 --> 00:08:43.210
If I perfect my walking, then I'm sure it'll benefit my performances too. {comma}

00:08:43.210 --> 00:08:45.960
You're our one and only model after all.

00:08:45.960 --> 00:08:47.840
Let's both give it our all.

00:08:47.840 --> 00:08:48.960
You bet.

00:08:55.560 --> 00:08:57.960
Now what should I do...

00:09:03.480 --> 00:09:07.980
I see. In the Fresh Girls Cup you go through several performances.

00:09:07.980 --> 00:09:11.230
It's important to save some energy for the very end.

00:09:11.230 --> 00:09:13.670
<i>Walking is my foundation.</i>

00:09:15.280 --> 00:09:18.740
<i>I'll try to remember the feelings I had when I first started Aikatsu</i>

00:09:18.740 --> 00:09:21.360
<i>so I can go on stage without fear.</i>

00:09:27.970 --> 00:09:30.180
Personalized training, huh...

00:09:30.180 --> 00:09:31.580
Hey, Hoshimiya. {or hey} {oy looks weird}

00:09:33.010 --> 00:09:34.130
Suzukawa-san.

00:09:34.130 --> 00:09:37.550
Aren't the semifinals today? What're you doing?

00:09:37.550 --> 00:09:40.890
I was trying to figure out what kind of training I'm suited for.

00:09:40.890 --> 00:09:44.360
Aoi has her research, and Ran has her walking. {Ichigo's not eloquent enough to do this in English}

00:09:44.360 --> 00:09:46.030
But I don't know what I have.

00:09:46.030 --> 00:09:48.430
Are you really going to get stuck on that?

00:09:49.150 --> 00:09:52.380
You want to beat Kanzaki Mizuki, don't you?

00:09:52.380 --> 00:09:52.900
I do.

00:09:52.900 --> 00:09:55.650
Then this is no time for you to be dragging your feet.

00:09:57.390 --> 00:10:00.410
Imagine yourself winning and run with all your might.

00:10:00.410 --> 00:10:02.840
Imagine myself winning...

00:10:05.910 --> 00:10:07.830
Thank you so much!

00:10:09.540 --> 00:10:12.810
<i>That's right. Rather than thinking, I'll just run with all my might!</i>

00:10:12.810 --> 00:10:15.550
I'll become a top idol just like Mizuki-chan!

00:10:17.140 --> 00:10:19.340
She really started sprinting away...

00:10:20.240 --> 00:10:21.800
Such a weirdo.

00:10:22.540 --> 00:10:25.330
<i>I may be just a soft-shelled turtle,</i>

00:10:25.330 --> 00:10:27.250
<i>and Mizuki-chan may be far beyond my reach,</i>

00:10:27.250 --> 00:10:28.810
<i>but I'll climb higher and higher...</i>

00:10:30.650 --> 00:10:32.920
<i>to get even one step closer to her!</i>

00:10:34.450 --> 00:10:37.070
It's the long-awaited semifinals!

00:10:37.920 --> 00:10:38.820
Listen!

00:10:38.820 --> 00:10:43.910
The rules haven't changed. Use an Appeal when I give the signal.

00:10:43.910 --> 00:10:47.870
You won't know the timing, so you mustn't let your guard down. Okay?

00:10:47.870 --> 00:10:49.080
Yes!

00:10:49.080 --> 00:10:50.410
Good!

00:10:55.240 --> 00:10:58.640
Hi, Beautiful Moon. Are you ready?

00:10:58.640 --> 00:11:00.590
Yes, I'm always ready. {I don't mind the "I was born ready" thing either}

00:11:01.770 --> 00:11:03.470
Come at me with everything you've got.

00:11:03.470 --> 00:11:04.760
We will!

00:11:21.080 --> 00:11:22.620
Let's appeal!

00:11:46.090 --> 00:11:47.470
Let's appeal!

00:11:59.630 --> 00:12:01.120
Let's appeal!

00:12:32.980 --> 00:12:34.240
Ichigo, congrats.

00:12:34.240 --> 00:12:36.690
Congratulations, you were great!

00:12:36.690 --> 00:12:39.190
Aoi... Ran...

00:12:44.700 --> 00:12:48.200
There's no guarantee that we'll be able to always go on together in Aikatsu.

00:12:48.200 --> 00:12:50.210
You can't look so down.

00:12:50.210 --> 00:12:54.210
I'm frustrated that I lost, but I'm also really happy that you made it.

00:12:54.210 --> 00:12:57.290
I'm your number one fan, you know. {stupid lost pun} {just be happy it's not strawberries again}

00:12:57.860 --> 00:12:59.210
Aoi...

00:12:59.210 --> 00:13:03.100
It's the same for me. I'm only angry with myself.

00:13:03.100 --> 00:13:07.220
Deep down in my heart I'm truly happy that you won.

00:13:07.860 --> 00:13:09.040
Thank you.

00:13:11.720 --> 00:13:14.260
I'm not surprised that Hoshimiya made it.

00:13:14.260 --> 00:13:15.100
Yes.

00:13:15.520 --> 00:13:19.860
Mizuki will use the semifinals and finals to test her.

00:13:20.210 --> 00:13:24.120
To determine whether Hoshimiya is the partner she's been searching for.

00:13:57.400 --> 00:13:59.270
Today's the finals. {or as they say in Europe, the "final"}

00:13:59.270 --> 00:14:01.900
We'll help you out for as long as we can.

00:14:01.900 --> 00:14:03.400
Get ready for the demon.

00:14:03.400 --> 00:14:04.780
Aoi, Ran...

00:14:04.780 --> 00:14:08.530
Thanks a bunch. You even helped me out last night.

00:14:09.550 --> 00:14:12.530
Let's begin the strategy meeting for Ichigo's final!

00:14:12.530 --> 00:14:15.990
So after we left, did you find a personal training regimen?

00:14:15.990 --> 00:14:18.090
Um, I sprinted!

00:14:18.090 --> 00:14:19.170
Just that?!

00:14:19.170 --> 00:14:19.860
Yep.

00:14:19.860 --> 00:14:21.990
You're the only one who could win with just that.

00:14:21.990 --> 00:14:25.800
At least it matched how strong your feelings were.

00:14:26.150 --> 00:14:28.550
I was too concerned with past data

00:14:28.550 --> 00:14:32.390
and ended up trying to save my energy for the finals.

00:14:32.390 --> 00:14:36.770
The reason I failed was that I was too relaxed

00:14:36.770 --> 00:14:38.940
and wasn't able to really get in the zone.

00:14:38.940 --> 00:14:41.970
I guess I just had something on my mind.

00:14:41.970 --> 00:14:42.900
What?

00:14:46.030 --> 00:14:47.670
You were worried about us?

00:14:48.200 --> 00:14:50.070
I got distracted, alright?!

00:14:50.070 --> 00:14:51.530
Is that true?

00:14:54.840 --> 00:14:56.700
Anyway, Ichigo!

00:14:56.700 --> 00:14:59.840
Focus on your style of training and aim to win!

00:14:59.840 --> 00:15:00.740
You got it!

00:15:05.190 --> 00:15:07.950
It's just like Ichigo to keep running until the finals.

00:15:07.950 --> 00:15:10.250
She's always running with all her might.

00:15:10.250 --> 00:15:11.330
Thanks.

00:15:12.780 --> 00:15:16.390
If I was alone, I don't think I'd be here right now.

00:15:16.390 --> 00:15:17.980
The reason I can continue running

00:15:18.330 --> 00:15:20.570
is because you two are here with me.

00:15:27.890 --> 00:15:30.990
The fact that I'll be on the final stage with Mizuki-chan

00:15:31.400 --> 00:15:33.990
means that even <i>I</i> have a chance at victory!

00:15:33.990 --> 00:15:35.410
Ichigo!

00:15:35.410 --> 00:15:36.370
Here I come.

00:15:39.240 --> 00:15:41.460
I've gotta give every last bit I've got! {what even is this training} {Ichigo-rashii tokkun, obviously}

00:15:45.380 --> 00:15:46.960
Let's go!

00:15:52.840 --> 00:15:54.800
Mizuki-san.

00:15:54.800 --> 00:15:57.760
Well then, I'm expecting a good performance.

00:15:59.960 --> 00:16:02.310
Mizuki-san, I'm going to do my best.

00:16:02.660 --> 00:16:05.140
There's something I want to say before we go on.

00:16:06.330 --> 00:16:07.470
Listen,

00:16:07.470 --> 00:16:12.110
I'm using this Fresh Girls Cup to search for a partner that I can pair with. {I feel like such an idiot only realizing now that they'll be the next Masquerade}

00:16:13.610 --> 00:16:15.950
And that might be you. {except if you think of STAR ANIS}

00:16:15.950 --> 00:16:18.330
I want to see you at full power.

00:16:18.330 --> 00:16:21.100
O-Okay! You see...

00:16:21.100 --> 00:16:22.620
I'm a soft-shelled turtle.

00:16:23.560 --> 00:16:28.130
The difference between you and me may be as great as that between the moon and a soft-shelled turtle.

00:16:28.130 --> 00:16:30.560
Still, I'll make this the best performance it can be. {while "live" may have entered our vocabularies, I don't think actual English speakers talk like that}

00:16:31.840 --> 00:16:33.130
So that's what you meant.

00:16:36.020 --> 00:16:38.850
I'll be using these Love Queen cards. {note to maybe capitalize}

00:16:39.300 --> 00:16:41.850
I want you to use your Premium cards.

00:16:42.660 --> 00:16:43.720
But then...

00:16:43.720 --> 00:16:45.900
You might win, right?

00:16:45.900 --> 00:16:48.870
Hold on to that chance and try to take me down.

00:16:50.160 --> 00:16:50.860
I will.

00:18:33.460 --> 00:19:22.260
Let's appeal!

00:20:11.860 --> 00:20:13.470
That sure was nervewracking.

00:20:13.470 --> 00:20:15.620
Second place is nothing to sneeze at.

00:20:15.620 --> 00:20:16.610
Yeah.

00:20:16.940 --> 00:20:18.530
Thanks.

00:20:18.530 --> 00:20:21.110
But Mizuki-chan really was the best.

00:20:21.110 --> 00:20:23.860
Her Love Queen dress was beautiful too.

00:20:23.860 --> 00:20:25.870
It really was!

00:20:26.710 --> 00:20:30.370
Although she couldn't match Kanzaki, Hoshimiya gave it her all.

00:20:30.710 --> 00:20:33.570
Kiriya and Shibuki put up a good fight too.

00:20:33.570 --> 00:20:37.110
You can tell how much research Kiriya did on past contests.

00:20:37.110 --> 00:20:40.040
I see she found her calling. {too off? She found yet another specialty isn't quite right either} {it's fine}

00:20:41.650 --> 00:20:45.390
Putting that aside, in this year's Fresh Girls Cup,

00:20:45.390 --> 00:20:49.140
the one who was most motivated was probably Mizuki.

00:21:27.760 --> 00:21:29.890
<i>I can't fall asleep...</i>

00:21:29.890 --> 00:21:31.210
So you've come.

00:21:33.810 --> 00:21:35.370
Mizuki-san.

00:21:35.370 --> 00:21:38.380
Because of your performance in today's finals,

00:21:38.380 --> 00:21:39.820
I can't seem to sleep.

00:21:41.200 --> 00:21:43.790
The two of us are senior and junior.

00:21:43.790 --> 00:21:46.230
The Starlight Queen and a rookie idol.

00:21:46.230 --> 00:21:47.750
And certainly...

00:21:48.700 --> 00:21:49.780
The moon

00:21:50.550 --> 00:21:51.730
and a soft-shelled turtle. {just turtle?} {nah, it should match}

00:21:53.550 --> 00:21:56.830
Even though we're both idols, 
there's a huge gap between us.

00:21:56.830 --> 00:21:58.330
Not quite.

00:21:58.330 --> 00:22:02.610
It's true that you aren't ready to be my partner just yet,

00:22:04.080 --> 00:22:08.300
but if you keep biting onto me like a soft-shelled turtle...

00:22:09.310 --> 00:22:10.840
Hoshimiya Ichigo.

00:22:10.840 --> 00:22:13.060
You might be able to become the sun.

00:22:20.350 --> 00:22:23.080
<i>I could be... the sun.</i>

00:23:55.720 --> 00:23:57.740
This week's Aikatsu Aphorism!

00:23:59.060 --> 00:24:01.660
We really meet a lot in the middle of the night.

00:24:01.660 --> 00:24:04.760
I love moongazing while taking long walks.

00:24:04.760 --> 00:24:07.380
It's not just to move the story along!

00:24:08.030 --> 00:24:09.880
Walk on sleepless nights.

00:24:10.630 --> 00:24:12.500
The first-years have their eyes on us...

00:24:12.500 --> 00:24:13.710
They're looking up to us!

00:24:13.710 --> 00:24:16.140
It just means that we're seniors that they can chase after.

00:24:16.140 --> 00:24:19.020
Forget about seniors, I'll have you become their teachers.

00:24:19.020 --> 00:24:20.350
Next time on Aikatsu!

00:24:20.350 --> 00:24:21.820
Idol Teacher.

00:24:21.820 --> 00:24:24.070
Always passionate, Idol Activities!
